OL,3,GNEWSAWoman named among Britons missing
OL,4,Ain Nepal floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman from has been named as one of
OL,7,Fthe 33 British nationals missing after
OL,8,Fdevastating flash floods in Nepal.
OL,10,FFishtail Tours and Travels confirmed
OL,11,FLeena Bector, from Slough, was among 27
OL,12,Ftravellers linked to the tour company
OL,13,Fwho remain unaccounted for.
OL,15,FHer husband, Bhupesh Bector, told The
OL,16,FTimes: "I know that she's in Nepal for
OL,17,Fsure, so even if they find her today or
OL,18,Ftomorrow, I need to be there."
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
